1	line	Player	No, of course not! See? It's a completely different rock, it's much smaller.
1	line	Guard	Alright, you be on your way then.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Svidi with half a rock
1	line	Player	Weren't you on your way to Rellekka?
1	line	Svidi	Weren't you on your way to get me a guarantee of safe passage into Rellekka?
1	line	Player	Well, I split this rock in your camp in two, you see, and I'm going to give half of it to Brundt so he will speak to you.
