0	section	Talking to Jokul
1	line	Player	How goes the goat herding?
1	line	Jokul	It goes, outerlander...
1	line	Jokul	Times are hard here at the moment. We've been here for too long and there is not much food left, or places where I can take my goats.
1	line	Player	Well, I'm trying to find a new supply of food for your people. Any ideas on where to start?
1	line	Jokul	If only it were so easy!
1	line	Jokul	That being said...
1	line	Player	Yes..?
1	line	Jokul	I have heard there is a certain kind of fruit... that will grow even here, in the mountains.
1	line	Player	What's the name of the fruit?
1	line	Jokul	It is called White Pearl, named after its white appearance.
1	line	Player	Any ideas on where to find some?
1	line	Jokul	I do not know. I believe it grows mainly in the mountains, and it can grow in even the most difficult circumstances.
1	line	Jokul	We cannot move on until we find the chieftain's daughter, and we do not generally move far inland. But perhaps you can search for it.
1	line	Player	I'll see what I can find.
1	action	end
