0	section	Shining Pool
1	line	Player	Hey, ehm... Asleif spirit thing? Hello?
1	box	'Yes, {player}?'
1	line	Player	I did what you asked me to! I improved the relations between Rellekka and the mountain camp, and I found a new supply of food!
1	box	'Yes, {player}, I can sense that this is so.'
1	line	Player	So do you have any other quests for me, perhaps with some bigger rewards?
1	box	'I do not fully understand what you speak of, but I do have one more task I would like you to do.'
1	box	'My father does not believe that I am dead. In his heart, he knows it to be true, but he cannot accept it.'
1	box	'You must convince him, {player}. Once you have convinced my father, everyone else in the camp will follow him. Then, perhaps, they can move on again.'
1	line	Player	How do I do that, exactly? I don't think I'll be able to get him down to this little island.
1	box	'I must leave that to you. All I know is that I was attacked by some creature or animal while I was sitting by the lake. It dragged me off and I remember nothing else.'
1	box	'Perhaps this will help you, I cannot provide further assistance.'
1	action	end
